  "name_en": "Langoustine Dining Experience",
  "summary_zh": "Fjöruborðið 位於冰島南岸 Stokkseyri，是當地最具代表性的海螯蝦餐廳之一，招牌料理包括 langoustine soup 與奶油蒜香海螯蝦。從 Reykjavík 開車約 1 小時左右\n\n這間龍蝦餐廳，是提供「小龍蝦」，動手吃起來比較簡單，同時份量也算蠻足夠了，口味也讓人滿意，會讓人二訪的餐廳。",
  "summary_en": "Fjöruborðið, located on Iceland’s south coast in Stokkseyri, is one of the most iconic langoustine restaurants in the area. Signature dishes include langoustine soup and butter‑garlic langoustine. It’s about a one‑hour drive from Reykjavík. The restaurant serves small lobsters that are easy to eat by hand, with generous portions and satisfying flavors, making it worth a second visit. Parking is free, and restrooms are also free on site. Expect to spend around 90 minutes enjoying the meal.",
